Most common english words
=========================

    >>> from zatso.upgoers.englishy import words

the
---

    >>> keys = list(words.keys())
    >>> assert "the" in keys, f"{[_ for _ in keys if 'the' in _]}"
    >>> assert words['the'].rank == 1

    >>> assert 'dog' in words
    >>> dog = words['dog']
    >>> assert dog.part_of_speech == 'noun'
    >>> assert dog.rank == 754

